WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.702 --> 00:00:07.717
To send one message to many people, open Send a message.

2
00:00:08.018 --> 00:00:11.889
First, pick where it goes out from: your bot, or your channel.

3
00:00:12.187 --> 00:00:16.394
With a bot, you can send to everyone, or to one of your audiences.

4
00:00:16.524 --> 00:00:19.381
Castvoo shows how many people will get it.

5
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.492
Now write your message.

6
00:00:21.622 --> 00:00:25.066
Tap Name, and each person sees their own first name.

7
00:00:27.978 --> 00:00:32.195
So "Hi {name}" becomes each person's name, like "Hi Tunde" here.

8
00:00:32.325 --> 00:00:37.177
If Telegram has no name, or it's a channel post, it says "there" instead.

9
00:00:37.478 --> 00:00:39.359
Add a button with your link.

10
00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:42.635
Every click is tracked, so you can see what works.

11
00:00:44.108 --> 00:00:45.691
Then choose when.

12
00:00:45.821 --> 00:00:51.857
Send now, schedule a date and time, or send at the next 9am in your workspace time zone.

13
00:00:52.156 --> 00:00:56.640
The "Stop these messages" button lets people opt out in one tap.

14
00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:00.086
That means fewer spam reports, and a safer bot.

15
00:01:00.386 --> 00:01:02.769
You can send yourself a test first.

16
00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:05.276
When it looks right, tap Schedule.

17
00:01:05.576 --> 00:01:09.937
Your messages are listed below, with how many were delivered and clicked.

18
00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:13.101
From here you can edit, pin, or delete them.
